  "abstract": "Re-submit with explicit create_network to avoid fallback to defaults (seen in IDs 192/193). Adds two light priors: U coherence on normalized U (\u03bb=2e-6) and s_beta L2 centering (\u03bb=1e-4), plus V-orthogonality (\u03bb=1e-5).",
